# 1.5.7: Gate Natural (the Play page's GATE all the way down, par157 4): each note held a sixteenth, as a key
# played, then the patch's envelopes ring it out; the screen and a screen reader say Natural
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 100
tap ENV
wait 100
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 24
turn SELECT 1 100
expect view 25
spin K2 -100
expect par157 4
listen
where
said Gate Natural
shot natural.png
